    them with ones:

    >>> jnp.nancumprod(x)
    Array([ 1.,  2.,  2.,  8.,  8., 48.], dtype=float32)

    Cumulative product along axis 1:

    >>> jnp.nancumprod(x, axis=1)
    Array([[ 1.,  2.,  2.],
